1
00:00:00,889 --> 00:00:04,019
(Amy:)If you don't mind me asking, why
did you and your wife split up?

2
00:00:04,025 --> 00:00:06,625
(Dave:)Oh, you know how it is...
we wanted different things.

3
00:00:06,628 --> 00:00:07,898
(Dave:)I wanted children,

4
00:00:07,896 --> 00:00:11,196
(Dave:)and she wanted a pastry chef
named Jean-Philippe.

5
00:00:11,199 --> 00:00:13,799
(Amy:)Oh, I'm... I'm so sorry.

6
00:00:13,802 --> 00:00:15,432
No, it's-it's fine.
It's why I left England.

7
00:00:15,437 --> 00:00:17,167
(Dave:)It reminded me
too much of her.

8
00:00:17,172 --> 00:00:22,012
(Dave:)Cold, gloomy and easily accessed
by a Frenchman through a tunnel.

9
00:00:23,477 --> 00:00:25,777
(Penny:)Hey. So, where are they?

10
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:27,910
(Bernadette:)Across the street,
in the left window.

11
00:00:27,916 --> 00:00:29,586
PENNY:
Oh, damn it,

12
00:00:29,584 --> 00:00:31,154
(Penny:)we should have brought
binoculars.

13
00:00:31,152 --> 00:00:33,582
(Bernadette:)Right here.

14
00:00:33,588 --> 00:00:36,118
We just happen to have those
in the car?

15
00:00:36,124 --> 00:00:37,654
(Bernadette:)Kinda. Before I met Howie,

16
00:00:37,659 --> 00:00:40,129
(Bernadette:)I liked to keep close tabs
on my boyfriends.

17
00:00:40,128 --> 00:00:41,598
(Leonard:)By stalking them?

18
00:00:41,596 --> 00:00:43,696
(Bernadette:)No. Stalkers
are creepy.

19
00:00:43,698 --> 00:00:45,598
(Bernadette:)I'm just a harmless little girl

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:48,330
(Bernadette:)with military-grade
spy equipment.

21
00:00:49,269 --> 00:00:50,639
PENNY:
Oh, there he is.

22
00:00:50,639 --> 00:00:51,969
BERNADETTE:
He's cute, right?

23
00:00:51,973 --> 00:00:54,343
Yeah!
Can I see?

24
00:00:54,342 --> 00:00:57,292
(Penny:)What, now you're interested?
You didn't even want to come.

25
00:00:57,292 --> 00:01:01,152
(Leonard:)I know, but you guys make being
a crappy friend look fun.

